[{"answer":"One dark and gloomy night, I was sitting in my bedroom reading ghost stories.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/1.mp3"},{"answer":"The stories were very scary. A storm was brewing outside my window.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/2.mp3"},{"answer":"The wind began to howl, and the trees shook and bent in the wind.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Lightning started to flash across the sky.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/4.mp3"},{"answer":"I felt uneasy as I heard the low rumble of thunder.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/5.mp3"},{"answer":"I glanced around my room.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/6.mp3"},{"answer":"The shadows were deep and dark.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/7.mp3"},{"answer":"The ghost stories were making my imagination play tricks on me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/8.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought that the shadows were moving.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/9.mp3"},{"answer":"I looked under my bed to make sure that nothing was under there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/10.mp3"},{"answer":"I hid under the covers and peeked out.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/11.mp3"},{"answer":"I was starting to hear things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/12.mp3"},{"answer":"A big streak of lightning flashed across the sky,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/13.mp3"},{"answer":"and a loud clap of thunder made me jump.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I was very nervous.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/15.mp3"},{"answer":"All of a sudden, I heard a noise.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/16.mp3"},{"answer":"It was coming from my closet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/17.mp3"},{"answer":"I thought that it must be a ghost.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/18.mp3"},{"answer":"I looked out from under my covers and waited for the ghost to appear.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/19.mp3"},{"answer":"My face was white, and I was very, very scared.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Then, I heard the noise again.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, there was definitely a rustling in my closet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/22.mp3"},{"answer":"I stayed very still and did not make a sound.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/23.mp3"},{"answer":"I watched the closet and hoped that the ghost would not come flying out at me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Something started to come out of the closet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I squeezed my eyes shut.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/26.mp3"},{"answer":"I didn't dare look at the ghost.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/27.mp3"},{"answer":"I heard it come out of the closet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/28.mp3"},{"answer":"I felt it jump up on my bed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/29.mp3"},{"answer":"I was still too scared to look.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Then the ghost made a noise.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/31.mp3"},{"answer":"It said, \"meow\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/32.mp3"},{"answer":"I opened my eyes and saw my kitten standing there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/33.mp3"},{"answer":"It was my kitten that had made the rustling noises in the closet.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/34.mp3"},{"answer":"I laughed and felt very foolish.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/35.mp3"},{"answer":"I have decided not to read ghost stories on dark stormy nights.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/36.mp3"},{"answer":"I think my imagination plays tricks on me when I read ghost stories on nights like that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/164-a-ghost-2019-04-07-04-35-39/37.mp3"}]
